  "slope_user_procedure": "The published 661-node 2D displacement file is not in this repository. Do not rerun Excel. On a workstation, expand griffiths_1999_coarse from pinned revision 440d246d9e32f5892c79539d4a7b797ad29442ee with interim/2026-10-30-Root635-full-audits-slope-reference/evidence-drivers/prepare-2d-slope-reference.py, build the plane-strain extrusions with prepare-3d-slope-match.py, and solve xy1-ny1 and xy2-ny2 at the same depth count. Do not mix ny changes into that pair. Pass one shared scalar displacement (the same material point or node on every in-plane mesh) and its original 2D value as a nested series: cargo run --release -- plane-strain-2d judge SERIES.json NEW_REPORT.json. Set nested_h_refinement true only for that in-plane pair. Leave it false for the archived depth and increment records."
